  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nCurrently authlib v0.15.5 is required, but it's outdated for a while\r\n\r\nThe latest release is [v1.0.1](https://github.com/lepture/authlib/releases/tag/v1.0.1) that has fixes for different things and thus allow integrations of other identity provider, like [Drupal Oauth2 server](https://www.drupal.org/project/oauth2_server)",
